  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Training: Satz vom Nullprodukt",
        "markdown": "Zehn Aufgaben zum Satz vom Nullprodukt. Bei einem Fehler bekommst du einen Hinweis und einen zweiten Versuch.",
        "showOutline": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $(x - 6)(x + 2) = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-2",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "6",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "2",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "x + 2 = 0 bedeutet x = −2.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 140
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t1",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 140
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Setze jeden Faktor null: $x - 6 = 0$ oder $x + 2 = 0$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $3x(x - 5) = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "0",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "5",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "3",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "3x = 0 bedeutet x = 0, nicht x = 3.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t2",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 280
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Der erste Faktor ist $3x$. Er ist null für $x = 0$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $(2x - 3)(x + 4) = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-4",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "1.5",
            "accepted": [
              "1{,}5",
              "1,5",
              "\\frac{3}{2}"
            ]
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "b",
            "latex": "3",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "2x − 3 = 0 ⇒ 2x = 3 ⇒ x = 1,5.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t3",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 420
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$2x - 3 = 0$ heißt $2x = 3$, also $x = 1{,}5$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "type": "task-yes-no",
      "data": {
        "question": "Stimmt das? Die Gleichung $(x - 3)(6 - 2x) = 0$ hat zwei verschiedene Lösungen.",
        "correctAnswer": false,
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 560
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t4",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 560
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$x - 3 = 0$ ergibt $x = 3$. $6 - 2x = 0$ ergibt ebenfalls $x = 3$. Also $L = \\{3\\}$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $x^2 - 7x = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "0",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "7",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 700
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t5",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 700
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Klammere $x$ aus: $x(x - 7) = 0$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $x^2 - 25 = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-5",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "5",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 840
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t6",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 840
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Dritte binomische Formel: $x^2 - 25 = (x + 5)(x - 5)$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "type": "task-choice",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Jona rechnet: $x^2 = 3x \\;|\\; : x \\;\\Rightarrow\\; x = 3$. Was ist falsch?",
        "variant": "single",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "o1",
            "markdown": "Er hat durch $x$ geteilt und dabei die Lösung $x = 0$ verloren.",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "id": "o2",
            "markdown": "Nichts, $L = \\{3\\}$ ist richtig.",
            "correct": false,
            "feedbackWhenChecked": {
              "message": "Setze x = 0 ein: 0 = 0. Also ist 0 auch eine Lösung.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "o3",
            "markdown": "Die Lösung ist $x = -3$.",
            "correct": false,
            "feedbackWhenChecked": {
              "message": "Probe: (−3)² = 9, aber 3 · (−3) = −9.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "shuffle": true,
        "partialCredit": false,
        "patternFeedback": [],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 980
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t7",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 980
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Setze $x = 0$ in die Gleichung ein. Richtig ist: $x^2 - 3x = 0 \\Rightarrow x(x - 3) = 0$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $6x^2 - 24 = 0$. Gib die Lösungen der Größe nach an.",
        "latex": "x_1=\\placeholder[a]{},\\quad x_2=\\placeholder[b]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "-2",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "2",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "-4",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Erst 6 ausklammern: 6(x² − 4). Dann x² − 4 = (x + 2)(x − 2).",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t8",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1120
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "$6x^2 - 24 = 6(x^2 - 4) = 6(x + 2)(x - 2)$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t9",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Gib eine Gleichung mit der Lösungsmenge $L = \\{-1;\\, 4\\}$ an.",
        "latex": "(x+\\placeholder[a]{})(x-\\placeholder[b]{})=0",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "1",
            "accepted": []
          },
          "b": {
            "expected": "4",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "-1",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Für x = −1 muss der Faktor null sein: −1 + 1 = 0.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t9",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1260
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Für $x = -1$ ist $x + 1 = 0$. Für $x = 4$ ist $x - 4 = 0$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t10",
      "type": "task-math",
      "data": {
        "instruction": "Löse $x^2 - 6x + 9 = 0$.",
        "latex": "x=\\placeholder[a]{}",
        "blanks": {
          "a": {
            "expected": "3",
            "accepted": []
          }
        },
        "compare": "symbolic",
        "partialCredit": false,
        "virtualKeyboard": true,
        "blankFeedback": [
          {
            "blank": "a",
            "latex": "-3",
            "feedback": {
              "message": "Probe: (−3)² − 6 · (−3) + 9 = 36.",
              "severity": "warning"
            }
          }
        ],
        "evaluation": {
          "mode": "auto",
          "enableRetry": false,
          "showFeedback": true,
          "allowSkip": false
        }
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hilfe-t10",
      "type": "title-simple",
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1400
      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Tipp",
        "markdown": "Zweite binomische Formel: $x^2 - 6x + 9 = (x - 3)^2$."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ende",
      "type": "end-tries",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
